# Chua mat khau -- tuyet doi khong commit
#
# Chan ca ten bien the, khong chi dung hai ten mac dinh. Mot may chay that hay
# co nhieu file canh nhau: config.m365.ini cho mot job khac, config.ini.bk va
# users.csv.bike de danh tu ca truoc. Tat ca deu chua mat khau, va chi can mot
# lan `git add -A` la len remote. Hai dong !ngoai-le duoi giu lai file mau va
# file cua testrig (chung khong co mat khau that).
config*.ini
!config.example.ini
!testrig/config.testrig.ini
config.ini.*

users*.csv
!users.example.csv
!testrig/users.testrig.csv
users.csv.*

*.pass
*.token
master-pass.txt
oauth-secret.txt
*secret*.txt

# Khoa rieng cua CA testrig -- sinh boi testrig/make-certs.sh
testrig/certs/

# Ket qua chay.
#
# 'logs*/' chu khong 'logs/', cung ly do voi config*.ini o tren: mot may chay
# nhieu job song song thi co logs-m365b/ va state-m365b/ nam canh, va hai ten
# do KHONG khop 'logs/'. Quan trong nhat la state-<ten>/: trong luc mot lan
# sync dang chay, no chua src.token va dst.token -- token OAuth con han, doc
# duoc toan bo mailbox cua tenant khach. Chung bi xoa khi chay xong, nhung
# `git add -A` dung luc dang chay thi da kip len remote.
logs*/
state*/
LOG_imapsync/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
